<title>USA: McDonnell Douglas, Boeing surge in preopen.</title>
<headline>McDonnell Douglas, Boeing surge in preopen.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of McDonell Douglas Corp and Boeing Co surged in preopen trading Monday following yesterday's announcement of plans for a $13 billion merger, traders said.</p>
<p>They said McDonnell Douglas shares were trading at 64 on the Instinet system, up from Friday's close of 52. Boeing was trading at 105, up from a Friday close of 96-3/4.</p>
</text>
